	(text "PG_15V = +15 V through 220k/62k, pulled to ground by PGP and PGN: about 3.2 V only when both rails are good, 0 V if either is bad or missing. It gates the amplifier REM switch."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 27 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1e5721ee-8bed-55ab-aeef-68a7c8c02ea3")
	)
	(text "ADP5071 values from datasheet Fig. 47 / Tables 9-11. LT3097: VOUT = 100 uA x RSET (147k = 14.7 V, +15 V is the top of its range); PGFB dividers 432k/10k trip power good near 13.3 V (also enables fast start-up)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 21 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "29dd072a-d5b4-501c-92d2-064058bdfefa")
	)
	(text "ADP5071AREZ (5 V in): +16.4 V boost and -16.5 V inverting rails; one LT3097 post-regulates them to +/-14.7 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4d985a7a-e57f-5b44-8013-30749171d8ac")
	)
